{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54340","headline":"赴章陵酬李卿留别 · 钱珝","name":"赴章陵酬李卿留别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一官叨下秩，九棘谢知音。\n芳草文园路，春愁满别心。\n（见《万首唐人绝句》卷八一、《钱考功集》卷十，均收作钱起诗。\n《全唐诗》卷二三九收作钱起诗）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱珝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54340.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54340","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}